        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Gannett\n- Products: Reno Gazette-Journal, Nevada State Journal\n- Places: Nevada\n- Organizations: Nevada School of Law\n- People: Henry Rust Mighels\n\nFacts:\n- In Nevada, the Reno Gazette-Journal is a daily newspaper owned by Gannett.\n- In Nevada, the Nevada State Journal ranked third behind the Reno Gazette-Journal among the state's largest newspapers.\n- Henry Rust Mighels was the editor of the Nevada State Journal.\n- The Nevada School of Law was moved to the Nevada State Journal plant.",
